6 14:49:55 +0000 2022', 'default_profile': True, 'default_profile_image': False, 'description': 'Writer & researcher exposing a world broken by greed. Boldly unearthing Big Pharma crime. Author Proposed FL https://t.co/O4G1LKkJg9 Mom to Cody fighting for his life!', 'entities': {'description': {'urls': [{'display_url': 'CodysLaw.org', 'expanded_url': 'http://CodysLaw.org', 'url': 'https://t.co/O4G1LKkJg9', 'indices': [109, 132]}]}, 'url': {'urls': [{'display_url': 'givesendgo.com/Amothersanthem', 'expanded_url': 'http://givesendgo.com/Amothersanthem', 'url': 'https://t.co/EyUBCEgGhf', 'indices': [0, 23]}]}}, 'fast_followers_count': 0, 'favourites_count': 21268, 'followers_count': 10831, 'friends_count': 9205, 'has_custom_timelines': True, 'is_translator': False, 'listed_count': 26, 'location': "A Mother's Anthem Substack", 'media_count': 1346, 'name': 'Heather Hudson', 'normal_followers_count': 10831, 'pinned_tweet_ids_str': ['1856974120568664275'], 'possibly_sensitive': False, 'profile_banner_url': 'https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1585282482366201857/1666815351', 'profile_image_url_https': 'https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1594746167170056200/6fuRxAzb_normal.jpg', 'profile_interstitial_type': '', 'screen_name': 'Amothersanthem', 'statuses_count': 17702, 'translator_type': 'none', 'url': 'https://t.co/EyUBCEgGhf', 'verified': False, 'want_retweets': False, 'withheld_in_countries': []}, 'professional': {'rest_id': '1599962722610958336', 'professional_type': 'Creator', 'category': [{'id': 1009, 'name': 'Community', 'icon_name': 'IconBriefcaseStroke'}]}}}}, 'unmention_data': {}, 'edit_control': {'edit_tweet_ids': ['1876777929688089037'], 'editable_until_msecs': '1736297301000', 'is_edit_eligible': False, 'edits_remaining': '5'}, 'is_translatable': False, 'views': {'count': '210982', 'state': 'EnabledWithCount'}, 'source': '<a href="http://twitter.com/download/iphone" rel="nofollow">Twitter for iPhone</a>', 'note_tweet': {'is_expandable': True, 'note_tweet_results': {'result': {'id': 'Tm90ZVR3ZWV0OjE4NzY3Nzc5MjkzNDg0MDcyOTY=', 'text': 'Open letter to Mark Zuckerberg. \n\nDear Mark, I’m sure you have seen the latest Congressional report on Covid-19. Maybe now you are ready to confront the impact of your actions over the past years. \n\nI am the mother of a 25 year old son. He is now a multiple stroke survivor. He became disabled after his Covid -19 shots left him with a life long blood clotting disorder that has ravaged his brain, all four limbs and his lungs. \n\nHis heart was damaged as it tried to pump blood with lungs full of blood clots. His doctors don’t know how he survived. \n\nHe was a runner and did not have Covid infection. He now spends his 20’s mostly confined to his room.\n\nHave you considered how many vaccine injury and death cases were censored and kept from being seen by others on Facebook? \n\nEven Congress questions the suppression and censorship of vaccine injuries online. \n\nHave you considered how many lives could have been saved by parents and doctors freely sharing data on severe and deadly vaccine adverse reactions? \n\nWhat kind of broken logic keeps mothers in the dark about medical dangers. \n\nIf my son Cody’s case could have been shared on Facebook, instead of being suppressed or removed, others could have had been warned about his horrific injury and made better choices. \n\nWhat kind of superiority complex silences mothers from warning other mothers. \n\nThese are indeed crimes against humanity! @VictorsVoice2 \n\nMark, you should know that mothers never back down. \n\nIt is time that you meet with the mothers and fathers of deceased and covid-19 vaccine injured kids who are disabled for life. \n\nLook at Cody’s Case, Victor’s, Maddie De Garay’s, Ernesto’s, Sean’s Case, Trista’s case… oh so many more! \n\nThen meet and look the parents in the eye and tell us why you would not let us reach out to find answers, to get help or to help other parents. \n\nHow will you ever make ammends to parents who only have gravestones to visit when they lost their children but were denied the very basic human decency of connecting with humanitarians who wished to help others with information about these vaccine injuries or adverse events now validated by congress. \n\nHow will you make amends to someone who can no longer walk and may not live another year? \n\nThank God Twitter began to allow these stories and the ability to share information. But this happened after my boy was left with a life threatening and life long peer reviewed and published vaccine injury. \n\nIn 2022 we were blessed with the help and comfort of countless other parents, advocates, doctors and other vaccine injured on Twitter.\n\nHowever, I am completely suppressed on Facebook. \n\nI wrote a Law to help get medical care to the vaccine injured and Facebook still won’t let me post it, or the few posts I have been “allowed” to publish are “suppressed” on facebook.\n\nChanges can’t come soon enough. \n\nCatch up with Congress and recognize that all the vaccine injured individuals who were suppressed and silenced were people who were dying and fighting for their lives. \n\nSo, please before you hail yourself a hero… Remember that you are a deeply flawed human who treated suffering people as if they were less than human.\n\nStill, I’m happy to meet in person and teach you about Cody’s Law and have you meet some of the other parents who care for kids left with feeding tubes. \n\nAre you humble enough to set up a grocery delivery charity for those who can’t work and are disabled after their vaccines?\n\nAre you humble enough to buy wheelchairs for the disabled?\n\nAre you humble enough to support a scholarship in that Victor set up before he died?\n\nAre you humble enough to help promote a law to help get medical care to the vaccine injured? \n\nLet’s talk mama y mano.\n\nCody’s mom\n\n@shdegaray73 @VictorsVoice2 @finkd @Answers4Sean @elonmusk @BrianneDressen @julie4butte5 @JanciToxDoc @JohnBeaudoinSr @annmforti @harryfisherEMTP @DrKellyVictory @NickCaturano @ChildrensHD @Hennac03 @IamBrookJackson @MarivicVillaMD5 @AllenDMartin @ake2306', 'entity_set': {'hashtags': [], 'symbols': [], 'timestamps': [], 'urls': [], 'user_mentions': [{'id_str': '1615007360208044034', 'name': 'Victor’s Voice', 'screen_name': 'VictorsVoice2', 'indices': [1398, 1412]}, {'id_str': '1433614184', 'name': 'Stephanie de Garay', 'screen_name': 'shdegaray73', 'indices': [3740, 3752]}, {'id_str': '1615007360208044034', 'name': 'Victor’s Voice', 'screen_name': 'VictorsVoice2', 'indices': [3753, 3767]}, {'id_str': '20749410', 'name': 'Mark Zuckerberg', 'screen_name': 'finkd', 'indices': [3768, 3774]}, {'id_str': '1449205340973699075', 'name': 'Answers4Sean 🇨🇦', 'screen_name': 'Answers4Sean', 'indices': [3775, 3788]}, {'id_str': '44196397', 'name': 'Elon Musk', 'screen_name': 'elonmusk', 'indices': [3789, 3798]}, {'id_str': '1613672448544886785', 'name': 'Brianne Dressen', 'screen_name': 'BrianneDressen', 'indices': [3799, 3814]}, {'id_str': '1731477745182687232', 'name': 'Julie4Butte5', 'screen_name': 'julie4butte5', 'indices': [3815, 3828]}, {'id_str': '1610128351582208000', 'name': 'Dr. Janci', 'screen_name': 'JanciToxDoc', 'indices': [3829, 3841]}, {'id_str': '1328008002', 'name': 'John Beaudoin, Sr., The Real CdC, The Last Boomer', 'screen_name': 'JohnBeaudoinSr', 'indices': [3842, 3857]}, {'id_str': '1360830665848152067', 'name': 'Ann Forti', 'screen_name': 'annmforti', 'indices': [3858, 3868]}, {'id_str': '1154793751027564544', 'name': 'Harry Fisher', 'screen_name': 'harryfisherEMTP', 'indices': [3869, 3885]}, {'id_str': '815273012', 'name': 'Kelly Victory MD', 'screen_name': 'DrKellyVictory', 'indices': [3886, 3901]}, {'id_str': '769189605048459264', 'name': 'Ordinary Guy in Strange Times-Your Life Has Value.', 'screen_name': 'NickCaturano', 'indices': [3902, 3915]}, {'id_str': '782018153207431168', 'name': 'Children’s Health Defense', 'screen_name': 'ChildrensHD', 'indices': [3916, 3928]